.SS History search keys
The interactive selector shows the history in the menu. Enter and Tab accept
the highlighted entry without running it, and Escape, Ctrl\-G, or any other
unrecognized key cancels and restores the line. The other menu keys act as in
the completion menu. The plain selector accepts these keys:
.TP
.BR Down ", " Ctrl\-N ", " Ctrl\-R
